    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rare Opportunity- Spacious 5 Bedroom detached Bungalow on large elevated 0.76 Acre Site adjacent to Knock Basilica.\r\n\r\nJohn Higgins Auctioneer is delighted to present to the market this exceptional five-bedroom detached Bungalow, extending to approximately 1,732 sq. Ft, occupying a superb elevated 0.76 Acre Site in one of Knock’s most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this combination of space, generous grounds and location rarely come to the market.\r\n\r\nSituated just off the main Knock to Ballyhaunis Road, this impressive property is immediately adjacent to the grounds of the world-renowned Knock Basilica and within a short walk of Knock village and its excellent range of amenities.\r\n\r\nThe property offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it an ideal family home. The accommodation comprises Entrance Porch, welcoming Hallway, a particularly large open-plan Sitting Room, Living Room with a Dining Area, Galley Kitchen, Utility Room, 5 Bedrooms and a family Bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe large utility area provides excellent flexibility and could potentially be easily adapted for use as an additional Bedroom or a means of increasing the overall size of the Kitchen area.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from a very good C BER rating reflecting the attention given to energy conservation in its design. Features include white PVC double glazed Windows throughout and an independent oil-fired central heating system.\r\nOutside the property is equally impressive. A Tarmac Driveway leads from the Road to the front and back of the House which allows for very private parking at the rear. There is a large front Garden and further Garden area at the very back of this impressive Site with a useful workshop, providing excellent additional storage or workspace.\r\n\r\nThe property’s location is a major selling point. Knock Village is within walking distance, with Shops, School, Church and its grounds, public transport and other amenities all close by. The Knock Basilica is approximately a 5-minute walk, while Ireland West International Airport Knock is only a short 20-minute drive, providing excellent accessibility for both domestic and international travel.\r\n\r\nThis is a genuine opportunity to a acquire a substantial five-bedroom detached home an 0.76 Acres in an exceptional Knock village location. Given the generous Site, spacious accommodation and proximity to Knock Basilica and village amenities, expectation would be for very strong interest and an early viewing would be recommended.\r\n\r\nViewing is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agent John Higgins Auctioneer on 094 9631372."
      },
